[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_10]
Muffin!

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_10_desc]
Wait... you can see the national focus’ effect now?\nIs it because Derpy is more familiar with you and opened her heart to you, or is there something in the muffin she just ate?

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_10_TOOLTIP]
Derpy Hooves is thinking about muffins, but what exactly she is thinking about, we will never know.

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_10]
马芬！

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_10_desc]
等等... 你现在能看到国策效果了？\n是因为呆蹄已经和你比较熟悉对你敞开心扉了，还是因为刚刚她吃的马芬里面有什么东西？

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_10_TOOLTIP]
呆蹄在思考关于马芬的问题，但是她究竟在想什么，我们永远不会知道。

